  "details": "If you slant the keyboard it doesn’t snap to an upright position and instead follows your head tilt, and if you keep it upright it never follows your head tilt and remains upright.\n\nThis means that you cannot have the keyboard properly upright without a lot of effort if you prefer it being slanted instead of straight, and can’t have it tilted if you prefer it being straight instead of slanted.\n\nAttached is a video of the VRChat keyboard’s current behaviour and my overlay keyboard’s behaviour for reference.",
